# The crossed power follows sin^2(pi z / (2 L_c)).
# Reference: that law with the coupling length from the supermodes of the grid.
title Directional coupler cut at 1.5 of its coupling length
window width=14 length=30.5
guide straight x=-0.35 width=0.5 from=0 to=30.5
guide straight x=0.35 width=0.5 from=0 to=30.5
launch mode x=-0.35 width=0.5
monitor bar z=30.5 x=-0.35 width=0.5
monitor cross z=30.5 x=0.35 width=0.5
expect power bar 0.496718241 2e-7
expect power cross 0.504989553 2e-7
expect neff 2.655703472 2e-8
expect power cross 0.50000 0.02
expect sum bar cross 1.0 2e-3
